       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI50104.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI50104.                                    *
      *                                                                *
      *     Consulta de Mensagens
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI50104         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD8101 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01 WS-SQL-AUXILIARY.
         05 IND-NULL                       PIC S9(04) BINARY.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV5020.
       COPY SWCV5021.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0010.
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
       COPY ETCL0002.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT8101 PIC X(08) VALUE 'SWVT8101'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      * PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME     PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI50104'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                        PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI50104         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV5020-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5020-ASE               TO SWCV5021-ASE.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2300-OBT-NR-MAX
                 THRU 2399-OBT-NR-MAX-EXIT
           END-IF

           MOVE SWCV5020-ADE               TO SWCV5021-ADE.

           PERFORM 2100-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2199-VALIDACOES-EXIT

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-INSERE-DADOS
                 THRU 2299-INSERE-DADOS-EXIT
           END-iF
           .
       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-VALIDACOES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-VALIDACOES.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           CONTINUE.

       2199-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2200-INSERE-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-INSERE-DADOS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2200-INSERE-DADOS' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5020-CCHAVE
             TO SWCD8101-CCODMSG
      *RR  MOVE SWCV5020-ZMSGORD
      *RR    TO SWCD8101-ZMSGORD
           MOVE SWCV5020-GMSG
             TO SWCD8101-GMSG
           MOVE SWCV5020-ILIDO
             TO SWCD8101-ILIDO
AG    *    MOVE SWCV5020-CPERFILC
AG         MOVE SWCV5020-CPERFILU
             TO SWCD8101-CPERFILC
AG    *    MOVE SWCV5020-CUSERIDC
AG         MOVE VIAL0001-CUTILIZA-I
             TO SWCD8101-CUSERIDC
           MOVE SWCV5020-CPERFIL
             TO SWCD8101-CPERFIL
           MOVE SWCV5020-CUSERID
             TO SWCD8101-CUSERID


           EXEC SQL
              SET :SWCD8101-HTIMEST = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
           END-EXEC.

           EXEC SQL
              SET :SWCD8101-HTIMESTC = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
           END-EXEC.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS

           EXEC SQL
                 INSERT INTO
                SWVT8101
                (
                   CCODMSG
                 , ZMSGORD
                 , GMSG
                 , ILIDO
                 , CPERFILC
                 , CUSERIDC
                 , HTIMESTC
                 , CPERFIL
                 , CUSERID
                 , HTIMEST
                )
                VALUES (
                       :SWCD8101-CCODMSG
                     , :SWCD8101-ZMSGORD
                     , :SWCD8101-GMSG
                     , :SWCD8101-ILIDO
                     , :SWCD8101-CPERFILC
                     , :SWCD8101-CUSERIDC
                     , :SWCD8101-HTIMESTC
                     , :SWCD8101-CPERFIL
                     , :SWCD8101-CUSERID
                     , :SWCD8101-HTIMEST
                )
           END-EXEC


              MOVE CON-SWVT8101               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME

              PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
                 THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT

              IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 IF DB2-DUPREC
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                      MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                        TO SWCV5021-CCHAVE-S
                      MOVE SWCK0001-CCODMSG-A-EXISTS
                        TO SWCV5021-CCHAVE-MSG
                      MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                        TO SWCV5021-CCHAVE-CAPLIC
                 ELSE
                   IF NOT DB2-OK
                     MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                     MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                           TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
                   END-IF
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           END-IF


           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
             MOVE SWCD8101-ZMSGORD TO SWCV5021-ZMSGORD
             MOVE SWCD8101-HTIMEST TO SWCV5021-HTIMEST
             MOVE SWCD8101-HTIMEST TO SWCV5021-HTIMESTC
           END-IF.

       2299-INSERE-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2300-OBT-NR-MAX
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2300-OBT-NR-MAX.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2300-OBT-NR-MAX' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.


           MOVE SWCV5020-CCHAVE  TO SWCD8101-CCODMSG

           EXEC SQL
                 SELECT IFNULL(MAX(ZMSGORD), 0)

                 INTO :SWCD8101-ZMSGORD

                 FROM SWVT8101

                 WHERE CCODMSG = :SWCD8101-CCODMSG
           END-EXEC


           MOVE CON-SWVT8101               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-OK
                 ADD 1 TO SWCD8101-ZMSGORD
              END-IF
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2300-OBT-NR-MAX-EXIT' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              MOVE 'SQLCODE          ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE  SQLCODE            TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.


       2399-OBT-NR-MAX-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5021-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV5021-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5021-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.


       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0010.
           COPY VIAP0016.
